Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission; apply after 0601.

The frontend sequence diagnostic still threw for every offline factory case it
had not admitted: CupCheaterScene (9), CrossFaderScene (16, the legal screen),
MoviePlayerScene/NLGLogoMovieScene (20/21), SHHallOfFameProfile (58),
HealthWarningSceneV2 (79), StrikerTimesOverlay (94), DemoOverlay (96) and the
plain loading overlay (99). Scripts can push any scene by number, so the
original code alone decides which of them appear. This admits them unchanged
under MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_OFFLINE_SCENES. Online scenes (24, 39-57,
93) stay gated until the native network services exist.

